AutoEq optimizer ports
------------------------
File:
  app/src/main/java/me/timschneeberger/rootlessjamesdsp/measurement/AutoEqEngine.kt

The Auto-EQ sharpness penalty (gain limit for an ~18 dB/oct slope and the
sigmoid coefficient) is ported from AutoEq, https://github.com/jaakkopasanen/AutoEq
(autoeq/peq.py, Peaking.sharpness_penalty).

The treble averaging in the optimizer loss (target and equalized response
collapsed to their region mean above a threshold frequency) is ported from
AutoEq (autoeq/peq.py, ParametricEqOptimizer._optimizer_loss).

